# Task 155-001 Execution Plan

## Objective
Write 200+ word Turkish/English technical documentation for deckent_start MCP tool.

## Source Files Read
- src/mcp/tools/start.ts — Full implementation analyzed

## Key Information Gathered
- Tool: deckent_start
- Parameters: autoApprove, dryRun, force, timeout, sandbox
- Behavior: Returns immediately with jobId, sprint runs in background
- Backend: fork() detached child process (sprint-runner-entry.js)
- Lifecycle: PLAN → SPAWN → EXECUTE → EVALUATE → FIX → RETRO → DECAY → CLEANUP
- Prerequisite: deckent_init + deckent_set_directives must be run first
- Dry-run mode: plans tasks but does not spawn workers
- Sprint lock: prevents duplicate concurrent sprints
- IPC directory cleanup: orphan cleanup before start

